st powerful cards (the jokers) for critical later plays or to counter bombs.\n\nReason:\nI should play ♣K because it efficiently beats the ♦Q while preserving my most valuable assets (both jokers). The King is my weakest high card, and using it here allows me to maintain control while keeping the rocket intact for countering potential bombs or securing victory later. Wasting jokers on a single Queen would be poor resource management.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣K"]}'}
